cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you found our work useful, please cite the article below."
title: "diabetes-xai-counterfactual"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of a five-class directional intervention taxonomy
  for counterfactual explanations in type-2 diabetes risk prediction. Encodes
  clinical actionability semantics as per-query DiCE constraints, without
  requiring a full structural causal model.
